> D.O.G turns the architecture into a full system</div><div class="card redline"><h2>Best Reading Order</h2><p><strong>Illustrated Symbols → Freemasons Degree I → Freemasons Degree III → Masons in the United Nations → D.O.G The Architect.</strong></p><p>This pathway turns curiosity about emblems into a full reader journey through ritual, symbol, institution, and hidden architecture.</p></div></section><section class="section wrap grid"><article class="card book-card"><div><div class="pill">Visual bridge</div><h2>The Illustrated Guide to Masonic Symbols</h2><p>The cleanest symbol dictionary door: tools, floors, pillars, lights, temples, and the visual grammar of meaning.</p></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="book-illustrated-guide-masonic-symbols.html">Book Page</a></div></article><article class="card book-card"><div><div class="pill">Degree ladder</div><h2>Freemasons Degree I</h2><p>The Apprentice awakening: initiation, darkness, light, preparation, and the first separation from the profane world.</p></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="book-freemasons-degree-1.html">Book Page</a></div></article><article class="card book-card"><div><div class="pill">Degree ladder</div><h2>Freemasons Degree III</h2><p>The Master Mason: death, vault, lost word, recovery, raising, and the inner architecture of initiation.</p></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="book-freemasons-degree-3-master-mason.html">Book Page</a></div></article><article class="card book-card"><div><div class="pill">Public record</div><h2>Masons in the United Nations</h2><p>A dossier-style bridge into public records, diplomacy, symbolism, global governance, and evidence boundaries.</p></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="book-masons-in-the-united-nations.html">Book Page</a></div></article><article class="card book-card"><div><div class="pill">Flagship</div><h2>D.O.G The Architect</h2><p>The masterwork: thirty-three gates through symbol, temple, mystery schools, AI, source, false crown, and hidden architecture.</p></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="dog-the-architect.html">Enter D.O.G</a></div></article><article class="card book-card"><div><div class="pill">Gateway file</div><h2>The Black File</h2><p>The free gateway that turns symbol curiosity into the wider Matrix Reprogrammed archive.</p></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="black-file.html">Request Access</a></div></article></section><section id="figure-source-status" class="section wrap source-status-panel"><h2>Figures & Sources</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Figures on this page</span><h3>Checked: 1 July 2026</h3><p>Numbers on this page are public-record leads. Crime, migration, sexual-offence, payout, death, and crisis figures must be tied to named official, court, police, parliamentary, regulator, or reputable source records before they are presented as settled.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence standard</span><h3>What counts as a usable figure?</h3><p>Official statistics, court records, ministry releases, police datasets, parliamentary material, regulator data, or clearly named public reports. Nationality, foreign-born status, asylum status, immigration status, charge, suspect, conviction, and victim categories must not be mixed.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Document trail</span><h3>Open the underlying record</h3><p>When the figure matters, follow the document link, source file, court record, official release, PDF, book, or video. The visible page should help readers reach the underlying evidence fast.</p></article></div></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-07-19","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","l